libxdp (xdp-tools, https://github.com/xdp-project/xdp-tools)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ebpf/src/bin/allnodes-xdp-dispatcher.rs is a Rust translation of
lib/libxdp/xdp-dispatcher.c.in (SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0), changed by Allnodes
in 2026. That source file and the object built from it, objects/allnodes-xdp-dispatcher,
are licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 (LICENSE-GPL-2.0). The
object is loaded into the kernel as a separate program; it is not linked with the rest
of this library. Its complete corresponding source is ebpf/, and scripts/build-ebpf.sh
rebuilds it.

src/dispatcher.rs mirrors the dispatcher configuration layout of
headers/xdp/prog_dispatcher.h (SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later OR
BSD-2-Clause), and the BTF lookup in src/bpf_sys.rs mirrors find_prog_btf_id from
lib/libxdp/libxdp.c (SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1 OR BSD-2-Clause,
